       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
identification division.
program-id. TEXT-PROBE.
environment division.
configuration section.
repository. function all intrinsic.
data division.
working-storage section.
copy "ST-FIELDS.cpy".
copy "ST-APP.cpy".
copy "ST-TEXT.cpy".
01 TEST-ID BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
01 TEST-KEY BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
01 TEST-FOCUS BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
01 TEST-RC BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
01 TEST-ROW BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
01 TEST-COL BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
01 TEST-FLAGS BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
01 TEST-NUM BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
01 TEST-PASSED BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
01 TEST-SAVED PIC X(1032).
01 TEST-VALUE.
  05 TEST-LENGTH BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
  05 TEST-NULL BINARY-SHORT SIGNED.
  05 FILLER PIC X(2).
  05 TEST-DATA PIC X(1024).
procedure division.
    INITIALIZE APP TEXT-UI
    MOVE 200 TO APP-STATUS MOVE 1 TO APP-ERRORS-LENGTH
    MOVE 2 TO ROLE-CODE
    MOVE "Edit" TO VIEW-MODE MOVE "NORMAL" TO T-PANEL
    MOVE 1 TO T-DISPLAY-WINDOW T-MODAL-WINDOW
    PERFORM VARYING TEST-ID FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL TEST-ID > 64
      MOVE -1 TO R-NULL(TEST-ID)
    END-PERFORM
    CALL "STSAMPLEOPEN" RETURNING TEST-RC END-CALL
    IF TEST-RC NOT = 0 STOP RUN RETURNING 1 END-IF
    CALL "STAUTH" END-CALL
    MOVE TAB-ID TO T-WINDOW-ID MOVE SESSION-DATA TO T-SESSION
    MOVE "2026-10-25" TO BUSINESS-DAY
    MOVE "REIWA" TO R-DATA(7) MOVE 5 TO R-LENGTH(7) MOVE 0 TO R-NULL(7)
    MOVE "𠮷é " TO R-DATA(5)
    MOVE LENGTH OF "𠮷é " TO R-LENGTH(5) MOVE 0 TO R-NULL(5)
    MOVE R-VALUE(5) TO TEST-SAVED
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL
    MOVE 1 TO TEST-NUM
    IF T-RC < 0 PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    MOVE 5 TO TEST-ID PERFORM FIELD
    IF TEST-ROW NOT = 5 OR TEST-COL NOT = 44 OR TEST-FLAGS NOT = 1
      PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 2 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE 119 TO TEST-KEY MOVE 5 TO TEST-FOCUS
    MOVE 0 TO TEST-RC
    CALL "STTESTFULL" USING TEST-RC TEST-VALUE END-CALL
    PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF R-VALUE(5) NOT = TEST-SAVED OR T-ACTION NOT = SPACES PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 3 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE 1 TO TEST-RC INITIALIZE TEST-VALUE
    MOVE "新𠮷é " TO TEST-DATA MOVE LENGTH OF "新𠮷é " TO TEST-LENGTH
    CALL "STTESTFULL" USING TEST-RC TEST-VALUE END-CALL
    PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF R-VALUE(5) NOT = TEST-VALUE OR T-ACTION NOT = SPACES PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 4 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE 1 TO STUDENT-ID CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL
    MOVE 4 TO TEST-ID PERFORM FIELD
    IF TEST-FLAGS NOT = 8 PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    MOVE R-VALUE(4) TO TEST-SAVED MOVE 4 TO TEST-FOCUS
    PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF R-VALUE(4) NOT = TEST-SAVED PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO STUDENT-ID PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 5 TO TEST-NUM
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL MOVE 7 TO TEST-ID PERFORM FIELD
    IF TEST-DATA(1:1) NOT = "R" OR R-DATA(7) NOT = "REIWA" PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    INITIALIZE TEST-VALUE MOVE "M" TO TEST-DATA MOVE 1 TO TEST-LENGTH
    CALL "STTESTSET" USING TEST-ID TEST-VALUE END-CALL
    MOVE 9 TO TEST-KEY MOVE 8 TO TEST-FOCUS PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF R-DATA(7) NOT = "MEIJI" OR R-LENGTH(7) NOT = 5 PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 6 TO TEST-NUM
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL MOVE 115 TO TEST-KEY MOVE 7 TO TEST-FOCUS
    PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF T-PANEL NOT = "PICK" OR T-PICK-COUNT NOT = 5 OR
      T-PICK-DATA(5) NOT = "MEIJI" PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL MOVE 123 TO TEST-KEY MOVE 9001 TO TEST-FOCUS
    PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF T-PANEL NOT = "NORMAL" OR T-FOCUS NOT = 7 OR R-DATA(7) NOT = "MEIJI"
      PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 7 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE "DELETE" TO EDITOR-PENDING
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL
    IF T-PANEL NOT = "CONFIRM" OR T-SPECIAL-DATA(2)(1:1) NOT = "N"
      PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    MOVE 116 TO TEST-KEY MOVE 9002 TO TEST-FOCUS PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF T-ACTION NOT = SPACES PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 8 TO TEST-NUM
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL MOVE 117 TO TEST-KEY PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF T-ACTION NOT = SPACES PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 9 TO TEST-NUM
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL MOVE 9002 TO TEST-ID
    INITIALIZE TEST-VALUE MOVE "Y" TO TEST-DATA MOVE 1 TO TEST-LENGTH
    CALL "STTESTSET" USING TEST-ID TEST-VALUE END-CALL
    MOVE 13 TO TEST-KEY PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF T-ACTION NOT = SPACES PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 10 TO TEST-NUM
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL MOVE 116 TO TEST-KEY PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF T-ACTION NOT = "CONFIRM" PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 11 TO TEST-NUM
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL MOVE 123 TO TEST-KEY PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF T-ACTION NOT = "CANCEL" PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 12 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE "UPDATE" TO T-ACTION MOVE 1 TO T-REQUEST
    MOVE 0 TO T-EXPECTED CONTEXT-REVISION T-SEQUENCE T-EDITOR-EXPECTED EDITOR-REVISION
    MOVE "REG" TO T-SCREEN
    CALL "STTEXTREQ" END-CALL
    IF APP-STATUS NOT = 400 PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE SPACES TO EDITOR-PENDING MOVE "Search" TO VIEW-MODE
    MOVE "SRC" TO T-SCREEN MOVE "SEARCH" TO T-ACTION MOVE 0 TO T-NAME-COUNT
    MOVE 1 TO T-REQUEST
    MOVE 13 TO TEST-NUM
    CALL "STTEXTREQ" END-CALL
    IF APP-STATUS NOT = 200 OR T-SEQUENCE NOT = 1 PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 14 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE 2 TO T-REQUEST MOVE 1 TO T-NAME-COUNT
    MOVE "studentName" TO T-NAME(1) MOVE 5 TO T-SLOT(1)
    CALL "STTEXTREQ" END-CALL
    IF APP-STATUS NOT = 400 PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 15 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE "name" TO T-NAME(1)
    CALL "STTEXTREQ" END-CALL
    IF APP-STATUS NOT = 200 PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 16 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE 3 TO T-REQUEST MOVE 2 TO T-NAME-COUNT
    MOVE "statusCode" TO T-NAME(1) T-NAME(2)
    MOVE 42 TO T-SLOT(1) MOVE 43 TO T-SLOT(2)
    CALL "STTEXTREQ" END-CALL
    IF APP-STATUS NOT = 200 PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 17 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE 4 TO T-REQUEST MOVE 42 TO T-SLOT(2)
    CALL "STTEXTREQ" END-CALL
    IF APP-STATUS NOT = 400 PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 18 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE 1 TO T-NAME-COUNT MOVE "oldField" TO T-NAME(1) MOVE 46 TO T-SLOT(1)
    CALL "STTEXTREQ" END-CALL
    IF APP-STATUS NOT = 400 PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 19 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE 0 TO T-NAME-COUNT MOVE 99 TO T-EXPECTED
    CALL "STTEXTREQ" END-CALL
    IF APP-STATUS NOT = 400 PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 20 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE 0 TO T-EXPECTED MOVE 2 TO T-REQUEST
    CALL "STTEXTREQ" END-CALL
    IF APP-STATUS NOT = 400 PERFORM FAILED END-IF PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 21 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE 200 TO APP-STATUS MOVE 1 TO APP-ERRORS-LENGTH
    MOVE 0 TO T-ERROR-COUNT MOVE "NORMAL" TO T-PANEL
    CALL "STDEFAULTS" END-CALL
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL
    MOVE 32 TO TEST-KEY MOVE 9042 TO TEST-FOCUS PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF R-NULL(42) NOT = -1 OR R-NULL(43) NOT = 0 PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 22 TO TEST-NUM
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL MOVE 116 TO TEST-KEY MOVE 4 TO TEST-FOCUS
    PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF T-ACTION NOT = "SEARCH" OR T-NAME(2) NOT = "name" PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    PERFORM PASSED
    MOVE 23 TO TEST-NUM
    MOVE 200 TO APP-STATUS MOVE 1 TO APP-ERRORS-LENGTH
    MOVE 0 TO T-ERROR-COUNT T-ERROR-SEEN
    MOVE "Edit" TO VIEW-MODE MOVE "NORMAL" TO T-PANEL
    MOVE "BAD" TO R-DATA(27) MOVE 3 TO R-LENGTH(27) MOVE 0 TO R-NULL(27)
    CALL "STRENDER" END-CALL MOVE 115 TO TEST-KEY MOVE 21 TO TEST-FOCUS
    PERFORM RUN-KEY
    IF APP-STATUS NOT = 422 OR T-PANEL NOT = "NORMAL" OR
      T-PICK-TOTAL NOT = 0 OR T-PICK-COUNT NOT = 0 OR R-DATA(27) NOT = "BAD"
      PERFORM FAILED END-IF
    PERFORM PASSED
    CALL "STSAMPLECLOSE" END-CALL
    DISPLAY "TEXT-PROBE PASS " TEST-PASSED
    STOP RUN RETURNING 0.
RUN-KEY.
    CALL "STTESTKEY" USING TEST-KEY TEST-FOCUS END-CALL
    CALL "STEVENT" END-CALL
    IF T-RC < 0 PERFORM FAILED END-IF.
FIELD.
    CALL "STTESTFIELD" USING TEST-ID TEST-VALUE TEST-ROW TEST-COL TEST-FLAGS
      RETURNING TEST-RC END-CALL
    IF TEST-RC NOT = 0 PERFORM FAILED END-IF.
PASSED.
    ADD 1 TO TEST-PASSED DISPLAY "TEXT-CASE " TEST-NUM " PASS".
FAILED.
    DISPLAY "TEXT-CASE " TEST-NUM " FAIL rc=" T-RC " status=" APP-STATUS
      " action=" FUNCTION TRIM(T-ACTION) " panel=" FUNCTION TRIM(T-PANEL)
    STOP RUN RETURNING 1.
